          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Easter eggs</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easter eggs are secret messages or jokes intentionally hidden within software code. The name borrows from the holiday ritual of Easter egg hunts, where children hunt for eggs that often contain surprises and treasures.</span></span></p>\n",
